<!doctype html>
<html><head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>WhatsApp pairing code</title>
<style>body{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:32rem;margin:4rem auto;padding:0 1rem}
code{font-size:2rem;letter-spacing:0.2rem;background:#f0f0f0;padding:0.5rem 1rem;display:inline-block;border-radius:0.5rem}</style>
</head><body>
<h1>Pair with phone number</h1>
{{if .Code}}
<p>On your phone: <em>Settings</em> &rarr; <em>Linked Devices</em> &rarr; <em>Link a Device</em> &rarr; <em>Link with phone number instead</em>, then enter:</p>
<p><code>{{.Code}}</code></p>
<p><small>The code expires shortly; request a new one if it lapses. This page does not auto-refresh.</small></p>
{{else}}
<p><strong>{{.Message}}</strong></p>
<p><a href="/pair">Back to QR pairing</a></p>
{{end}}
</body></html>
